[{"client_msg_id":"bacbe239-bcd4-4fbc-befb-ecb772277aa0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"素早い作業を目指す場合も同様で、持つ動作→動かす動作 と分ければOKですね\n同時にすばやくやるのはどうやっても無理なので、分けた上でそれぞれ速くできるようにすればOKです","ts":"1622308330.265900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VwIL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84d2b5c0-9581-430b-bb79-bf4408040aea","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"自分で認識できたことで自分の作業にとっても、細かい作業も早くできるようになったので良かった","ts":"1622308228.264500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wuvr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ac4ebed-943f-47eb-b8d3-f3ca4e02b32d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"記事に書いたことは私はもともと無意識でできてたんですが、後輩指導のために言語化しましたね","ts":"1622308190.263600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01BY3SDBRS","U01U44T1FK2"]},{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XhhOX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e650efc6-2956-44c2-88c5-8b936c70343e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ですね。私はネル使うこと多くて、左手はネルドリッパーに奪われてます（笑）","ts":"1622308148.263000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NL1T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba33e2ea-784e-4e2f-b4c1-aa4aa2860566","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"これは見たことなかったけど、まあそうなりますよね","ts":"1622308116.262500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BN4i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ef8d453-2d71-43a4-86db-41efdba3dbd4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ほー","ts":"1622308107.262000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EMT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e1bdc58-cbc6-440c-8b3a-b6ae0eb2ec4a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"コーヒーに関してはKONOのシャッチョーさんが、利き手で持ち、脇を締め、反対の手は布越しにポットの底を支えると良いと話してましたね。まさに今回の負荷分散と支店固定の話に通じます。\n確かこの動画 \u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xazCxSA703c\u003e","ts":"1622308090.261500","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 【神回】河野社長直伝『正しい』コーノ式の淹れ方 コーヒーの旨味だけを最大限に引き出す方法〜社長がそう言うなら間違いないっ！","id":1,"author_name":"/岩崎泰三 -Coffee Journalist Taizo Iwasaki -","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeINwQHFhHwXNZ4_nNBiIQg","title":"【神回】河野社長直伝『正しい』コーノ式の淹れ方 コーヒーの旨味だけを最大限に引き出す方法〜社長がそう言うなら間違いないっ！","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xazCxSA703c","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xazCxSA703c/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xazCxSA703c?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xazCxSA703c","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xazCxSA703c"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAWu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b13f6dfc-3ce6-40bf-9d50-3e51dafab73f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なんやかんやで1時間くらいかかってしまったな","ts":"1622308062.260900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ci56"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d43f932e-7367-4b49-b221-82289e2fc91d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"かいた","ts":"1622307208.258300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K4xZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b67257eb-a5a5-4343-b26c-ec5e2f7c186b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://kmiz.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/05/30/015229\u003e","ts":"1622307207.258000","attachments":[{"fallback":"KosukeMizuno’s blog: 細かい作業のコツ - KosukeMizuno’s blog","id":1,"title":"細かい作業のコツ - KosukeMizuno’s blog","title_link":"https://kmiz.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/05/30/015229","text":"ピンセット操作など細かい作業の参考になれば。 実験準備に手先の器用さが要求される研究をしていたので、学会とかで雑談をすると実験大変だよね〜的な話をたびたびしていました。 同じ業界ではだいたいみんなやっている作業だったりするのですが、どうも話を聞いていると僕は結構手先が器用なほうみたいです。 研究室メンバでも手先の器用・不器用には差があって、後輩に教えるときわかりやすくするために色々考察していたので簡単にまとめようと思います。 この記事では細かいはんだ付けやピンセットを使った移動を想定していますが、結構広く使える考え方だと思います。 手先が（自称）不器用な人はたいていピンセットの持ち方・動かし方…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/26006613769799047/26006613769809119/1622307149","blocks":null,"ts":1622307149,"service_name":"KosukeMizuno’s blog","service_icon":"https://kmiz.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://kmiz.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/05/30/015229","original_url":"https://kmiz.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/05/30/015229"}],"edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1622307221.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":7,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V","U012MBD7MFZ","U022XK5866Q","U01U44T1FK2","U01BY3SDBRS","U776661HA"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wVVr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"331177d4-c689-4b4b-b0f3-fa5e82be784b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"アカウントだけ作ってブログは？どこ？って探してた","ts":"1622303932.257600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=hD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d848116-081c-4325-b3b6-cfe2f8ebdca2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"はてなって色々サービス出しとるんだな...知らなかった...","ts":"1622303921.257300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Lc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc95bd4a-2ba7-411c-a74c-0b7edf5f80f9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ようやくはてなブログを作るところまできた","ts":"1622303906.256900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"txf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc98b2d9-fd64-43d5-98a4-fbc7e170ca79","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"解決策：一撃で仕留めればOK","ts":"1622303841.256500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiwa","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WOWY3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aed867ee-5172-4146-8a01-4fe4a6f81086","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"銅線20umは意外と強度があるのでやり直しができるんですが、金の蒸着膜で作ったランドに付けていたのでやり直しができなかった\n金はハンダに溶け込んでいくので、高温を保っているとランド自体が消滅していくんですよね","ts":"1622302652.256000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xTW6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"103d03c0-9252-4ec1-9364-66659d84730b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"昼に書いた20ミクロンのはんだ付け、付ける先にも問題があってやり直しがほぼ効かない（できても1,2度）状況だったので大変修行になったｗ","ts":"1622302564.254500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pjw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be546dc9-dd5f-441b-8e0a-2ffbff0a032a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この辺の理屈を理解しておくと一度で決めないといけないはんだ付けとかピンセット移動とかが確実になりますｗ","ts":"1622302500.253400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a5m7u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"927588e3-82a2-4e5e-95b8-020a4df4a11e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そういえばブログとか持ってないな\n作るか","ts":"1622302443.252400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CfB6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1d1fe50-cbe6-417c-be00-cc5b15c2d4b9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どこかにまとめてほしい","ts":"1622302419.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s5n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3df803ad-ff7f-43bf-83ba-990ebd141e68","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ひたすらリアクションするbot化してしまいました。感謝","ts":"1622302412.251800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zuhp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f7210d6-a6f9-4271-a421-141ad34d0970","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ためになる文章を書いてしまった（自画自賛）","ts":"1622302403.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Sw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31537a9d-ee61-4e23-8b19-d8bb417c9046","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"知見だ…","ts":"1622302389.251000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LAL+D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e43e881e-f800-4972-a28c-8f534d2239f0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こんなところか","ts":"1622302308.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"god","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"69b9bbe795f19442","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yxj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a4d0c12-1f0a-4a7d-bf5d-c38ffecdc02a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"写真撮るときに脇を締めるのも同じ原理","ts":"1622302119.250400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCJu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d8efaa7-14da-4e36-8bf4-1e1d62b06ef5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"動きの幅が小さくなる＆ブレの源が減る の両立で細かい作業がしやすくなります","ts":"1622302042.250000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8qs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de863035-2842-4e3d-b43b-90bddcf88f76","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"また手振れの原因は筋肉の緊張による微細な振動なので、先の方をどこかにつけていればつけている場所より肩側の筋肉は手ブレの原因にならないわけです","ts":"1622302003.249200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aah3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"757b50d8-1964-484a-8c16-d03104c9c5a7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"手が完全に浮いていると肩から先がブレます\n手首を机につけていれば手首から先のブレだけです","ts":"1622301907.247500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aNtu3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19c2611d-c714-466a-9ed0-84230330e4d8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もうひとつのポイントは単純で、支点をなるべく近くにすればブレにくい（ブレが小さくなる）ってことです","ts":"1622301848.246400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K92r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bde761d0-c282-4ff9-9329-5f4192969bbf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"動かす指と固定に使う指が別れているから細かい作業ができるわけですね","ts":"1622301737.245400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7l4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc522dd4-318f-42ee-8d1b-0feae130d166","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"皆さん箸を使うなんて意識せずにできると思いますが、よく見ると親指＋薬指で固定された箸＆親指を支点に人差し指中指で動かす箸の2本からなります","ts":"1622301689.244800","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1622301701.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=9T5f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10166e02-ebcc-46b2-bd51-38ce02af335c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"箸の操作を考えてもらうとわかりやすいかと","ts":"1622301601.243300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EHu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aee8221-9810-4f15-b09b-323d8099d601","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"片手だとしても親指人差し指は固定に専念、移動は手首の動作で行う、といった感じでできます","ts":"1622301532.242700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0DkJb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a130e79-3708-479f-9ff8-3fd7652c86d2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あーそれすっごいよさそう……!","ts":"1622301492.241900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p0Z9y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d97cd807-9fdb-493f-ae68-352e95bdcff9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"例えばはんだ付けではなくピンセットで移動させるだけの場合、右手ピンセットでつまんで（右手はつまむだけに集中）、左手で右手に触れて動かすなど","ts":"1622301448.241500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A/GOg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"878283dc-577e-4775-83f6-717f3948defc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"細かい作業（移動させるとか）と力のいる作業（つまんだ部品を保定しておく）を両立させないといけないのが難しいポイントなので、腕のどこの部位が担当するのかを決めておくと簡単になります","ts":"1622301379.240100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6PBx0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"144a7f58-e7e8-493a-a42f-4fd8a2d8fef5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ポイントは2点あって、つかう筋肉を分けることと腕のなるべく先の方をどこかにつけることが大事","ts":"1622301239.237800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CwcQQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d29c8a3-a148-4dd6-a3bc-7195fec8e553","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"手先が起用じゃないと自称する人、持ち方がなってないだけってことがよくある","ts":"1622301137.236700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kGOW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbd7c79d-ca51-4fac-a7d7-e9ed83ab7bae","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ピンセットの持ち方や動かし方もあまり説明されないですが大事ですね","ts":"1622301105.236200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5FUU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bb7dbdc-b018-4e5a-8509-de2a94aa35af","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"はんだ付けのノウハウが言語化されない、と昼に書きましたけど","ts":"1622301082.235700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FZ9tY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b48a949-a86d-48c6-9c2c-e6ca535b2e93","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"おお、便利そう……","ts":"1622301068.235400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ap4K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6ee2c1a-bd16-4622-9826-fc81017be2b3","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そこにポリイミドテープもあったらだいたいなんとかなりますね","ts":"1622300839.234700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5m078"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5b692de-0dc3-4809-bd35-7e3787b2aadd","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"初電子工作+表面実装でも反作用ピンセット、温調、CとDのこて先を用意しとけば案外なんとかなったので、装備って大事だなーと思いました。","ts":"1622300567.234000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"megx0"}]}]
